    "It is not known whether the Anvil is a natural feature or the creation of some ancient magic. While the Anvil rock itself is unlike any mineral found nearby, it does not appear to be unusual in any way. Miners and stonemasons from all over Aramon have eyed the Anvil as a possible source of fine marble, but as of yet, the Anvil stands largely untouched.": "铁砧岩究竟是自然地貌，还是某种古老魔法的产物，至今不得而知。铁砧岩本身与附近任何矿物都不同，但看上去并无异常之处。阿拉蒙各地的矿工与石匠都曾把铁砧岩视作优质大理石的可能来源，然而时至今日，它基本仍未被开采。",
